A research agent used to fetch several documents in one turn, but after a refactor it makes one tool call per turn, tripling latency. The refactored harness appends results like this:
```
{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01",...}]}
{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_02",...}]}
```
What is the most likely cause?
